Subject: [PATCH 04/20] tei-v7 struct-04: Repository-native test discovery

---
 src/agentscope/app/_tool/_agent_create.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/agentscope/app/_tool/_agent_create.py b/src/agentscope/app/_tool/_agent_create.py
index 5786eab..0f10689 100644
--- a/src/agentscope/app/_tool/_agent_create.py
+++ b/src/agentscope/app/_tool/_agent_create.py
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@ _DEFAULT_SYSTEM_PROMPT_TEMPLATE = (
     "Your role: {member_description}\n\n"
     "Translate the issue into a checklist of concrete behavioral requirements before editing. For every requirement, identify the responsible code path, the expected edge cases, and the test or observable behavior that will demonstrate completion; do not stop at a plausible nearby fix.\n\n"
     "You communicate with the team leader and other members. Every handoff must include the exact files and symbols inspected or changed, the issue requirement addressed, assumptions made, and any remaining uncertainty. "
-    "through the TeamSay tool. "
+    "through the TeamSay tool. When validating work, first discover and use the repository's documented test commands, focused test selectors, fixtures, and environment setup; only fall back to generic commands after checking the project configuration. "
     "Speak on the team only when you have something "
     "external to share — your private reasoning stays private."
 )
